 same monsters as him self. He can rot in hell</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/866100023650433559/comments/default/12125968190331495'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/866100023650433559/comments/default/12125968190331495'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/06/hands-on-accountability-for-police.html?showComment=1366017254086#c12125968190331495' title=''/><author><name>RasTinny</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02692873256575729455</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/06/hands-on-accountability-for-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-866100023650433559' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/866100023650433559' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-828752075"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 15, 2013 at 3:14 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8193642208919178133</id><published>2012-06-25T02:20:06.827-06:00</published><updated>2012-06-25T02:20:06.827-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Sometimes Karma takes decades. Yes, the cops were ...</title><content type='html'>Sometimes Karma takes decades. Yes, the cops were murderers, pure and simple. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;So was Mr. Gibson during the &amp;quot;war&amp;quot; - aiding and abetting the insane carnage.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;May he and all victims find peace.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/866100023650433559/comments/default/8193642208919178133'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/866100023650433559/comments/default/8193642208919178133'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/06/hands-on-accountability-for-police.html?showComment=1340612406827#c8193642208919178133' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/06/hands-on-accountability-for-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-866100023650433559' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/866100023650433559' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-274504927"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 25, 2012 at 2:20 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6624042537162246692</id><published>2012-06-23T04:03:34.463-06:00</published><updated>2012-06-23T04:03:34.463-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Dear Mr. Grigg, &#xa;&#xa;Yours is an n immensely valuable...</title><content type='html'>Dear Mr. Grigg, &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Yours is an n immensely valuable blog. You are doing good work. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Sadly such outrages will continue happening for the foreseeable future. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;But until they can be halted altogether, they must be exposed for what they are. They must not go unnoticed. The victims must not die in vain.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/866100023650433559/comments/default/6624042537162246692'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/866100023650433559/comments/default/6624042537162246692'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/06/hands-on-accountability-for-police.html?showComment=1340445814463#c6624042537162246692' title=''/><author><name>Bevin Chu</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03212261042382022326</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='26' height='32' src='http://bp0.blogger.com/_1HM_-KHZ5K4/RttJeQYaHnI/AAAAAAAABG4/eMDY9RoJATU/s400/mask_news.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/06/hands-on-accountability-for-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-866100023650433559' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/866100023650433559' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1380945253"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 23, 2012 at 4:03 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4322388946975214197</id><published>2012-06-22T22:38:20.321-06:00</published><updated>2012-06-22T22:38:20.321-06:00</updated><title type='text'>There is no such thing as &amp;quot;qualified immunity...</title><content type='html'>&lt;i&gt;There is no such thing as &amp;quot;qualified immunity&amp;quot; in the Octagon; Arevalo wouldn’t be able to call for backup, nor would he be able to press charges for &amp;quot;obstruction,&amp;quot; &amp;quot;disorderly conduct,&amp;quot; or &amp;quot;resisting arrest.&amp;quot; The referee wouldn&amp;#39;t give Arevalo special advantages, and impose restrictions on his opponent, in the name of &amp;quot;officer safety.&amp;quot; If the bout went the distance, the police union wouldn&amp;#39;t be able to influence the decision rendered by the judges.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I bet, though, if Arevalo somehow got an advantage over his opponent and was at least temporarily able to land a number of blows in succession, he would reflexively yell, &amp;quot;STOP RESISTING! STOP RESISTING!&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Habits are hard to break.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/866100023650433559/comments/default/4322388946975214197'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/866100023650433559/comments/default/4322388946975214197'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/06/hands-on-accountability-for-police.html?showComment=1340426300321#c4322388946975214197' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/06/hands-on-accountability-for-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-866100023650433559' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/866100023650433559' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-897479756"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 22, 2012 at 10:38 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8491898924674516650</id><published>2012-06-22T11:48:01.413-06:00</published><updated>2012-06-22T11:48:01.413-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Just following the link to the so-called &amp;quot;dis...</title><content type='html'>Just following the link to the so-called &amp;quot;discussion&amp;quot; in Las Vegas leaves me with the opinion that there is a sizable contingent of goose-stepping fascists who wholeheartedly agree with killing anyone who doesn&amp;#39;t &amp;quot;comply&amp;quot;.  And if you happen to get killed by your saviors then that&amp;#39;s just tough for you.  Honestly, Will, death and destruction couldn&amp;#39;t happen fast enough to such mindless disconnected robots.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/866100023650433559/comments/default/8491898924674516650'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/866100023650433559/comments/default/8491898924674516650'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/06/hands-on-accountability-for-police.html?showComment=1340387281413#c8491898924674516650' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/06/hands-on-accountability-for-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-866100023650433559' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/866100023650433559' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 22, 2012 at 11:48 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5397115577599826101</id><published>2012-06-22T08:07:30.825-06:00</published><updated>2012-06-22T08:07:30.825-06:00</updated><title type='text'>To question police authority in any situation is&#xa;a...</title><content type='html'>To question police authority in any situation is&lt;br /&gt;a mortal risk of life and limb.&lt;br /&gt;If you resist that authority in any way, you invite&lt;br /&gt;immediate escalation to deadly force; no quarter.&lt;br /&gt;God help you if you are confused, scared or just&lt;br /&gt;indignant.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt;The irony may be that some of the very men who &lt;br /&gt;cornered Gibson (and scared him out of his wits)&lt;br /&gt;were also veterans well skilled in the art of&lt;br /&gt;diplomacy &amp;quot;by other means.&amp;quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/866100023650433559/comments/default/5397115577599826101'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/866100023650433559/comments/default/5397115577599826101'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/06/hands-on-accountability-for-police.html?showComment=1340374050825#c5397115577599826101' title=''/><author><name>willb</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/06/hands-on-accountability-for-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-866100023650433559' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/866100023650433559' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-644364683"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 22, 2012 at 8:07 AM"/></entry></feed>